Use the same IOP sysmem allocator for original heap RPC clients and direct HLE calls; reuse freed space.
Original heap initialization binds the client, preserving its compiled FreeIopHeap routine.
API reference only: https://github.com/ps2dev/ps2sdk/blob/master/ee/kernel/src/iopheap.c (no source copied).

